      "content": "It sounds like you are feeling overwhelmed by fear and a deep sense of loss regarding your own identity. Please know that these feelings of hopelessness are signals of intense distress, and there is support available to help you through this. If you are in crisis or feeling like you might hurt yourself, please reach out immediately to a lifeline like the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline. They are free, confidential, and available 24/7 to listen without judgment.",
